  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The Black man in the suit is mapped as the 'enemy' who provides a job",
  "description": "The top text 'any time you have to rely upon your enemy for a job' explicitly identifies the visual entity (the Black man) as the 'enemy'. This creates an analogical mapping where the man is projected as the 'enemy' in the context of the meme's message about economic desperation. The visual material (the man) is mapped onto the textual concept of 'enemy' to reinforce the racialized trope of welfare dependency.",
